\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sl276\slmult1\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Ade resa, owia ahintaw ni,
\par ade  nyinaa y[ komm p[ ne home.
\par O, me koma, [d[n  na wop[ afei?
\par Onyame nky[n na nya ahomeye.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 \cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \}kwantuni abr[ n' ogye ne home.
\par Anomawa, ]k] ne berebuw mu.
\par Na nkok] no, w]aba 'b[da pesu mu.
\par Na mep[ d[n?  M'Agyenkwa no kokom!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Me Nyankop]n, woahw[ me nn[ s[ m'Agya
\par woaky[[ ne so, mahu wo nhyira.
\par Mens[  koraa s[ woy[ me yiye saa.
\par Miyi me yam meda wo so ase.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 \cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Wiase ha asisis[m gyigyee me;
\par mafom  no nn[; mesr[ s[ faky[ me.
\par \{y[ me yaw pii s[ mehow wo wer[.
